'''Perimeter Outpost Delta''', also known simply as '''Outpost Delta''', was an outpost located on the [[planet]] [[Hoth]]. It was far to the northwest of [[Echo Base]] and a hundred [[meter]]s outside the base's energy shield, consisting of a three-person [[laser]] [[turret]], a hand-dug trench and a handful of light [[artillery]] emplacements. It was notably used by the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]] during the [[Battle of Hoth]].<ref name="Battlefront" />

